medical evaluation. He is a known case of
benign prostatic enlargement. Today he is
complaining of urinary problems in form of
difficulty starting micturition and dribbling at the
end of urination, as well as constipation. He
also has back pain and left thigh pain. On
examination, there is decreased sensation over
the medial aspect of the left lower leg. Which
