her outstretched right hand. Immediately
after the fall, she felt severe pain in her right
wrist. On examination in the emergency
department, there is tenderness over the
lateral aspect of the head of the radius and
the anatomical snuffbox. Application of axial
pressure to the thumb of the affected hand
causes pain. An X-ray is ordered which is
completely normal. Which one of the
following is the next best step in
management?','{"A":"Reassurance.","B":"Place the wrist in thumb spica cast\nand repeat the X-ray in 7-10 days.","C":"Repeat the X-ray in 6 weeks.","D":"Analgesics.","E":"Place the wrist in a sugar tongue\nsplint."}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Orthopaedic  (1).pdf","supporting_pages":[206,207],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":"exact-b974bac77e2c","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"ef5c1737273e210c5c8a","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 Orthopaedic  (1).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Orthopaedic  (1).pdf","source_page":206,"source_qid":null}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"v27_cross_page_option_stitch","text_method":"tesseract_retry_200dpi_psm3","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'needs_verification','[]','medium','{"record_id":"ef5c1737273e210c5c8a","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 Orthopaedic  (1).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Orthopaedic  (1).pdf","source_year":2025,"source_page":206,"supporting_pages":[206,207],"source_qid":null,"domain_hint":"Orthopaedics/Rheumatology","stem":"A 34-year-old woman trips over and falls on\nher outstretched right hand. Immediately\nafter the fall, she felt severe pain in her right\nwrist. On examination in the emergency\ndepartment, there is tenderness over the\nlateral aspect of the head of the radius and\nthe anatomical snuffbox. Application of axial\npressure to the thumb of the affected hand\ncauses pain. An X-ray is ordered which is\ncompletely normal. Which one of the\nfollowing is the next best step in\nmanagement?","options":{"A":"Reassurance.","B":"Place the wrist in thumb spica cast\nand repeat the X-ray in 7-10 days.","C":"Repeat the X-ray in 6 weeks.","D":"Analgesics.","E":"Place the wrist in a sugar tongue\nsplint."},"source_answer":null,"source_explanation":null,"source_answer_status":"pending_import","current_answer":null,