ESO WOM a Drecente withrewenitie
in front of his right ear. He also complains of
dry itchy eyes and a dry mouth. On
examination, right parotid and xerostomia
are remarkable findings. Fine needle
aspiration cytology (FNAC) is performed
which is significant for lymphocytes without
